{
  "bodyHash": "9e6d55d62b9b781a",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/bundle.png\" alt=\"A Serilum Bundle. Made with love. Serilum&#x27;s mods combined, for easier downloading!\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-bundle.svg\" alt=\"About the bundle\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Extra Bundle（额外整合包）</strong>是一种特殊类型的模组，它将 Serilum 的多个<strong>extra-type（额外类型）</strong>模组合并为一个。虽然我觉得将我的模组分组非常困难，但我尝试这样做是为了让安装变得更加容易。它使用了一种名为 JiJ（Jar in Jar，Jar 内包含 Jar）的系统。这基本上意味着所包含的模组保持完全独立，同时允许像整合包一样进行捆绑安装。所有模组仍然拥有各自的配置文件，并且你会在游戏内的模组列表中看到它们全部列出。<br><br>该整合包是模组包开发的额外辅助工具，但它并不取代我个人偏好的模块化模组系统。不过，可以通过整合包的配置文件禁用所包含的模组。<strong>更改配置后需要重启游戏才能生效。</strong><br><br>由于 JiJ 系统的工作方式，它既兼容正常安装该模组的情况，也兼容与该模组整合包中包含的模组共存的情况。这主要用于强制使用特定版本，但如果以这种方式意外安装了两次模组，也不会造成问题。虽然这可能不是问题，但最好只安装一次。因此，如果你决定安装此整合包，你可以移除任何与此整合包中重复的其他模组。<br><br>我希望这个整合包对那些偏好大型内容模组的用户有所帮助。非常感谢大家多年来给予的支持！<br><br></span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"Dependencies\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"Requires Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/both.svg\" alt=\"Environment: Client &amp; Server\" width=\"293\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"Configurable\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"Configuration guide\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的配置选项：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableAllLootDrops</strong>&nbsp;(默认值 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableAprilFools</strong>&nbsp;(默认值 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableBiggerSpongeAbsorptionRadius</strong>&nbsp;(默认值 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableBouncierBeds</strong>&nbsp;(默认值 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableCryingGhasts</strong>&nbsp;(默认值 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableCryingPortals</strong>&nbsp;(默认值 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableDeathBackup</strong>&nbsp;(默认值 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableEasyElevators</strong>&nbsp;(默认值 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableEdibles</strong>&nbsp;(默认值 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableExtractPoison</strong>&nbsp;(默认值 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableFallThroughSlime</strong>&nbsp;(默认值 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableFasterCrouching</strong>&nbsp;(默认值 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableFixedAnvilRepairCost</strong>&nbsp;(默认值 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableGrassSeeds</strong>&nbsp;(默认值 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableHandOverYourItems</strong>&nbsp;(默认值 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableInfiniteTrading</strong>&nbsp;(默认值 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableMilkAllTheMobs</strong>&nbsp;(默认值 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableNameTagTweaks</strong>&nbsp;(默认值 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enablePaperBooks</strong>&nbsp;(默认值 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enablePassiveEndermen</strong>&nbsp;(默认值 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enablePlaceableBlazeRods</strong>&nbsp;(默认值 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableRandomBoneMealFlowers</strong>&nbsp;(默认值 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableRandomSheepColours</strong>&nbsp;(默认值 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableRandomShulkerColours</strong>&nbsp;(默认值 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableShulkerDropsTwo</strong>&nbsp;(默认值 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableTNTBreaksBedrock</strong>&nbsp;(默认值 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableTranscendingTrident</strong>&nbsp;(默认值 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableVillagerDeathMessages</strong>&nbsp;(默认值 = true)</span></div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/available-bundles.svg\" alt=\"Available Bundles\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">以下 Serilum 模组整合包可供使用：</span></p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-client-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-client-bundle.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#006994\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-client-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum 客户端整合包</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-customization-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-customization-bundle.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#999\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-customization-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum 自定义整合包</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-extra-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-extra-bundle.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#804d4f\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-extra-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum 额外整合包</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-qol-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-qol-bundle.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#bf8f6f\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-qol-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum QoL 整合包</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-rpg-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-rpg-bundle.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#006b3f\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-rpg-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum RPG 整合包</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-spawn-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-spawn-bundle.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#805a46\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-spawn-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum 出生点整合包</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/mods-included.svg\" alt=\"Mods included\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/all-loot-drops\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/all-loot-drops.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/all-loot-drops\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">全掉落物</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">生物以可配置的数量掉落所有可能的掉落物，支持抢夺附魔。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/april-fools\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/april-fools.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/april-fools\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">愚人节</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">在愚人节启用各种滑稽和有趣的可配置功能！</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bigger-sponge-absorption-radius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/bigger-sponge-absorption-radius.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bigger-sponge-absorption-radius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">更大的海绵吸水半径</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">每多放置一个相邻的海绵方块，都会增加吸水半径。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bouncier-beds\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/bouncier-beds.gif\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bouncier-beds\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">更有弹性的床</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">使玩家在床上以可配置的高度弹起，并防止在床上坠落受伤。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/crying-ghasts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/crying-ghasts.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/crying-ghasts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">哭泣的鬼怪</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">当玩家靠近时，鬼怪会定期掉落眼泪，从而实现可持续种植。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/crying-portals\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/crying-portals.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/crying-portals\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">哭泣传送门</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">允许使用哭泣黑曜石方块创建下界传送门。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/death-backup\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/death-backup.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/death-backup\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">死亡备份</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">在玩家死亡前创建物品栏备份，可通过命令加载。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-elevators\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/easy-elevators.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-elevators\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">简易电梯</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">通过多维块电梯轻松快速上下！高度可配置，使用现有资源。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/edibles\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/edibles.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/edibles\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">可食用物品</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">使大量材料变得可食用，食用后玩家获得短暂的增益效果。允许食用烈焰粉、萤石粉、岩浆膏、糖、ghast泪、幻翼膜和兔子脚。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/extract-poison\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/extract-poison.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/extract-poison\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">提取毒药</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">用空玻璃瓶从洞穴蜘蛛、河豚和蜜蜂身上提取毒药。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fall-through-slime\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/fall-through-slime.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fall-through-slime\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">穿过 slime</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">粘粘块在不活跃时不再支撑你的重量，你会慢慢穿过去。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/faster-crouching\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/faster-crouching.gif\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/faster-crouching\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">更快的潜行</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">潜行时也能以正常速度冲刺和行走。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fixed-anvil-repair-cost\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/fixed-anvil-repair-cost.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fixed-anvil-repair-cost\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">修复铁砧修理成本</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">修补铁砧以设置默认的等级成本、材料成本和修复百分比。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/grass-seeds\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/grass-seeds.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/grass-seeds\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">草种子</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">允许玩家使用普通种子将泥土变成（高）草。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hand-over-your-items\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/hand-over-your-items.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hand-over-your-items\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">交出你的物品</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">为游戏内玩家提供了一种无需丢弃/投掷即可互相给予物品堆的能力。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/infinite-trading\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/infinite-trading.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/infinite-trading\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">无限交易</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">防止村民交易锁定，使其始终可用。尽情交易吧！</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/milk-all-the-mobs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/milk-all-the-mobs.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/milk-all-the-mobs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">给所有生物挤奶</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">允许绵羊、骆驼、猪、驴、马和骡子产出一桶牛奶。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/name-tag-tweaks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/name-tag-tweaks.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/name-tag-tweaks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">命名牌调整</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">添加命名牌的合成配方、命令，且拥有名字的生物死亡时会掉落其命名牌。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/paper-books\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/paper-books.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/paper-books\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">纸书</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">允许使用9张纸制作书籍。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/passive-endermen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/passive-endermen.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/passive-endermen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">被动末影人</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">防止末影人在被注视时传送、放置/拾取方块（破坏）或攻击。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/placeable-blaze-rods\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/placeable-blaze-rods.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/placeable-blaze-rods\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">可放置的烈焰棒</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">使烈焰棒像末地烛一样可作为自定义方块放置在世界中。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/random-bone-meal-flowers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/random-bone-meal-flowers.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/random-bone-meal-flowers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">骨粉随机花朵</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">随机化骨粉生成的花朵，允许所有（模组）类型在任何地方生成。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/random-sheep-colours\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/random-sheep-colours.gif\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/random-sheep-colours\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">随机羊毛颜色</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">新刷新的羊根据可配置列表拥有随机的羊毛/绒毛颜色。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/random-shulker-colours\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/random-shulker-colours.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/random-shulker-colours\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">随机潜影贝颜色</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">新刷新的潜影贝根据可配置列表拥有随机的外壳颜色。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shulker-drops-two\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/shulker-drops-two.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shulker-drops-two\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">潜影贝双倍掉落</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">允许潜影贝掉落两个或多个贝壳，并忽略其默认掉落概率。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tnt-breaks-bedrock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/tnt-breaks-bedrock.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tnt-breaks-bedrock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TNT 破坏基岩</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">允许 TNT 破坏基岩，轻松进入下界屋顶！</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/transcending-trident\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/transcending-trident.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/transcending-trident\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">超越三叉戟</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">增强三叉戟。手持水桶可以在任何地方使用更强大的激流效果。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/villager-death-messages\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/villager-death-messages.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/villager-death-messages\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">村民死亡消息</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">每当村民去世时广播一条信息性死亡消息。</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>只要下載檔案仍託管於 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內，您可以自由地在任何整合包中使用此模組包。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供所有可用模組的概覽及更多資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由於我無法在這麼多不同的模組頁面中追蹤評論，因此已關閉評論功能。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>若有任何問題、想法、建議或其他事項，請前往 <a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 倉庫</a>。謝謝！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
